2. THE r-INVARIANCE PREDICTION - tested BEFORE the main table
==============================================================================
Entry 194 measured that in the psi form the |z| profile is
r-INVARIANT while |c| is r-DEPENDENT, and that in the pi form BOTH
are r-dependent. Entropy is a functional of the normalised profile
alone, so the prediction transfers exactly:

    psi  Neff_z   IDENTICAL across all cells of a given depth
    psi  Neff_c   varies with r
    pi   Neff_z   varies with r
    pi   Neff_c   varies with r

