==============================================================================
6. Neff AGAINST PR - two estimators of the same effective count
==============================================================================
Both return n on a uniform distribution over n modes and 1 on a
point mass. PR is the inverse collision probability (Renyi order
2), Neff the exponential of the Shannon entropy (order 1), so PR
<= Neff for any distribution and the gap measures how heavy the
head is. The question here is whether they RANK cells the same.

